cff-version: 1.2.0
title: ShadowScan
message: >-
  If you use ShadowScan in research or an internal security
  program, please cite this repository.
type: software
authors:
  - name: Project Nexus contributors
    website: https://github.com/aisecnomad/Project-Nexus
repository-code: https://github.com/aisecnomad/Project-Nexus
url: https://aisecnomad.github.io/Project-Nexus/
abstract: >-
  ShadowScan discovers evidence of AI agents and related
  integrations across code repositories, identity providers,
  LLM gateway logs, low-code platforms, SaaS apps, and cloud
  accounts, then reconciles findings against an approved
  inventory of Agent Cards.
keywords:
  - shadow-ai
  - ai-agents
  - mcp
  - security
  - inventory
  - langchain
  - sarif
license: Apache-2.0
version: 0.1.1
